lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, June to July has come in under 90% of normal in 42 of the 75 years since 1951 on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 8 grids, the most of any pair. In 2025 the middle saw October to November at 30% of normal and September to October at 50%. So far in 2026, January to February sits at 32% and May to June at 202%. Every grid had its driest year in 2011, with grid 9733 at 39%.</p>"}
